Peform the following steps to produce the plots in the figures.

1. Download the data from the Community Challenge website as described in the main ReadMe.

2. Navigate to the "Generate_Data" folder.
  - run the script to take the POD, making sure to specify the number of modes r to be kept

2. Navigate to the various "Forecast_X" folders, and run the desired code.
  - the code can take a considerable length of time to run
  - the code will produce output files to be used for plotting

3. Navigate to the "Plots" folder, and run the desired code.
